            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The exchanges of the train manufacturing are derived from an assessment of the "IC 2000", a long-distance train which is currently used for long distance transportation in Switzerland .The life span of the train  is assumed to be 40 years resulting in a life time performance of  20’000’000 vkm. The dominating material is alluminium to reduce the weight and hence energy consumption in operation.;
UUID: 7bc9ba5f-0268-383b-972c-b7943329e993</common:generalComment>
