        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">In 2000 the modelled train represents the state of the art of long distance transport in Switzerland. In the near future the share of this train type on the total long distance transport will be increased.\n\n# Included processes\nThis inventory calls processes of material production, representing the material composition of a standard Swiss Long-Distance Train (IC 2000) For manufacturing, electricity and light oil burned in industrial furnace are included. For the transportation of materials standard distance are applied.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
        </technology>
